<title>INDONESIA: Jakarta exchange closed for financial year-end.</title>
<headline>Jakarta exchange closed for financial year-end.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jakarta's stock exchange was closed on Monday due to the last day of Indonesia's financial year.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the Jakarta composite index rose 2.84 points, or 0.43 percent, to close at 662.24 points after touching a low of 658.11 points.</p>
<p>The market was also closed for the Easter holiday on Friday. Trading resumes on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
